# Mercury Tours – QA Testing Project

## 1. Project Name
Mercury Tours – Web Application Testing

## 2. Project Overview
This project focuses on testing the Mercury Tours web application to verify its functionality, usability, integration, and browser compatibility.

The project includes manual test case design and execution, defect reporting, test result documentation, and testing summary/sign-off documentation.

## 3. Application Name
Mercury Tours

## 4. Application URL
https://demo.guru99.com/test/newtours


 ## 5. Testing Scope / Modules
The following 7 areas were covered:

1. Login
2. Registration
3. Flight Search
4. Navigation
5. Support / Contact
6. Special Offers and Flight Prices
7. External Links

## 6. Testing Types Performed
- Functional Testing
- Regression Testing
- Integration Testing
- Browser Compatibility Testing

## 7. Tools and Technologies
- Microsoft Excel – Test case and test execution documentation
- Web browser – Application testing
- Git / GitHub – Project version control and repository

